the same ideas? Hi, I'm Jennifer and in this\h
lesson, we'll look at several different ways\h\h

3
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:23,280
to form adverb clauses of time so that you have\h
a bit more variety in your speaking and writing.\h\h

4
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:32,560
Variety is what can help you go from basic English\h
to more advanced English. Let's start. Do you have\h\h

5
